# Status chips

**Canonical:** [`StatusBadge`](apps/frontend/src/components/page/status-badge.tsx) — nested `size-5` icon square + label inside `h-8` ringed chip.

Use for every table/detail status, payment, read/unread, draft/complete, subscription state, etc. Do **not** invent parallel pills (`rounded px-2 py-0.5` text-only badges).

## API

```tsx
<StatusBadge label={t('payment.paid')} tone="success" icon="check-read-bold" />

{/* Interactive — shadcn Button, same chrome */}
<StatusBadge
  label={t('receipts.counter', { read, total })}
  tone="info"
  icon="users-group-rounded-bold"
  onClick={() => open()}
/>
```

| Prop | Rule |
|------|------|
| `label` | i18n string (never raw English API enums) |
| `tone` | `success` \| `danger` \| `warning` \| `info` \| `neutral` \| `gold` |
| `icon` | **Required** — Solar `*-bold` semantic to the state |
| `onClick` | Optional — when present, renders shadcn `Button` with identical chip look |

## Icon picks (examples)

| State | tone | icon |
|-------|------|------|
| Paid / read / active / available | success | `check-read-bold` |
| Unpaid / low / banned / expired | danger | `danger-triangle-bold` |
| Partial / unread / past_due | warning | `bell-bing-bold` or `notification-unread-lines-bold` |
| Draft / inactive / neutral | neutral | `notes-bold` |
| Completed / gold / current | gold | `medal-star-bold` |
| Info / receipts / trial | info / gold | `users-group-rounded-bold` / `crown-star-bold` |

## Must not

- Plain `StatusBadge` without `icon`
- Ad-hoc status `<span className="rounded px-2 …">` in tables
- Native `<button>` chips that skip shadcn `Button` when clickable
